* Transistors
M5 4 6 5 5 PMOS
M1 3 3 0 0 NMOS
* Capacitors
CL 6 0 CL_value
CX 2 5 CX_value
* Resistors
RD 6 0 RD_value
RS 3 1 RS_value
? Missing component
* Voltage Source
VDD 5 0 DC VDD_value
* Node mappings:
* 1: Vin1
* 2: X (input of current source)
* 3: Source of M1 and negative terminal of Rs
* 4: Drain of M5
* 5: VDD and positive terminal of CX
* 6: Vout1 and negative terminal of RD
.end
